{
  "answer": "You can configure CORS to allow requests from specific origins in FastAPI by using the `CORS` class and setting the `origins` parameter. For example:\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, CORS\n\napp = FastAPI()\ncors = CORS(app, allow_origins=[\"http://example.com\", \"http://localhost:8080\"])\n```\nAlternatively, you can use the `CORSAllowCredentials` parameter to allow credentials in requests:\n```python\ncors = CORS(app, allow_origins=[\"http://example.com\"], allow_credentials=True)\n```",
